```plaintext
CLASS Game
    INIT
        INITIALIZE grid with a 4x4 structure
        INITIALIZE timer
        INITIALIZE difficulty level
        CALL shuffle_tiles

    METHOD provide_hint
        RETURN "Hint: Move tile 5 to the right."

    METHOD shuffle_tiles
        FLATTEN tiles from grid
        SHUFFLE flat_tiles
        FOR EACH TILE in flat_tiles
            CALCULATE new row and column
            ASSIGN tile to grid position (row, column)
            
CLASS Grid
    INIT(size)
        CREATE a 2D list of Tile objects for the grid
        INITIALIZE tiles with numbers according to their positions
        
CLASS Tile
